title: Party Dues
subtitle: Raise or lower the members’ dues.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.duesAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.dues (technical reference 13.1; card catalogue 5.4): raise, lower or keep (Z — 0.51), 1 T, cd 6 M;
// returning the card to the hand is free.
PolishParty.partyDisplay(Q);
Q.pl_dues_keep_why = PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'keep').reason;
Q.pl_dues_raise_why = PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'raise').reason;
Q.pl_dues_lower_why = PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'lower').reason;
!}

= Party dues

Dues are [+ dues +] (from 1 to 4). Monthly income: [+ pl_party_ledger +].

- @keep
- @raise
- @lower
- @easy_discard

@keep
title: Keep the present dues
subtitle: 1 T; the dues stay at [+ dues +] and the card waits 6 months; nothing else changes.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'keep').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dues_keep_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.duesChoose(Q, 'keep');
!}
go-to: result

@raise
title: Raise the dues by 1
subtitle: More income per member; the membership falls ×0.98 at once, ×0.95 when real wages are below 90 or unemployment is 8% or more. The target of membership falls 5% for every level above 2.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'raise').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dues_raise_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.duesChoose(Q, 'raise');
!}
go-to: result

@lower
title: Lower the dues by 1
subtitle: Less income per member; membership +2 at once, and the target of membership rises 5% at level 1.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.duesStatus(Q, 'lower').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_dues_lower_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.duesChoose(Q, 'lower');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Party dues

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
